    "Into a worktree": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans un worktree"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En un worktree"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In einen Worktree"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issues": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Issues"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Issues"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Issues"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It comes out of .sikemux/tasks.json.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est retiré de .sikemux/tasks.json."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se quita de .sikemux/tasks.json."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wird aus .sikemux/tasks.json entfernt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It comes out of sikemux.json; commit that to remove it for the team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est retiré de sikemux.json ; commitez ce fichier pour le retirer pour l'équipe."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se quita de sikemux.json; haz commit de eso para quitarlo para el equipo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wird aus sikemux.json entfernt; committe das, um es für das Team zu entfernen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It did not go to {label}: {error}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'est pas allé vers {label} : {error}"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No llegó a {label}: {error}"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ging nicht nach {label}: {error}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It gets its address once added; each request to it fires the trigger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il reçoit son adresse dès son ajout ; chaque requête qui l'atteint le déclenche."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtiene su dirección al añadirlo; cada solicitud que recibe activa el disparador."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es bekommt seine Adresse, sobald es hinzugefügt ist; jede Anfrage daran löst den Trigger aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has commits that are not in the branch it started from. Deleting it loses any that were not pushed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle contient des commits absents de la branche d'origine. La supprimer perd ceux qui n'ont pas été poussés."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiene commits que no están en la rama de la que partió. Al eliminarla se pierden los que no se enviaron."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er hat Commits, die nicht im Ausgangsbranch sind. Beim Löschen gehen alle verloren, die nicht gepusht wurden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has not been online since this computer last heard of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été en ligne depuis la dernière fois que cet ordinateur a eu de ses nouvelles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No ha estado en línea desde la última vez que este ordenador supo de él."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es war nicht online, seit dieser Computer zuletzt davon gehört hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It installs once no agent is in the middle of a turn. Open to update now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il s'installe dès qu'aucun agent n'est en plein tour. Ouvrez pour mettre à jour maintenant."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se instala cuando ningún agente está a mitad de un turno. Ábrelo para actualizar ahora."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es installiert sich, sobald kein Agent mitten in einem Zug ist. Öffnen, um jetzt zu aktualisieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is not signed in yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'est pas encore connecté."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no ha iniciado sesión."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist noch nicht angemeldet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is signed in to your Sikemux account. Allow or decline it in Sikemux.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est connecté à votre compte Sikemux. Autorisez-le ou refusez-le dans Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha iniciado sesión en tu cuenta de Sikemux. Permítelo o recházalo en Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist bei deinem Sikemux-Account angemeldet. Erlaube oder lehne es in Sikemux ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is signed out of your account and taken off every host at once. To use it again, sign it in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est déconnecté de votre compte et retiré de tous les hôtes à la fois. Pour l'utiliser à nouveau, reconnectez-le."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se cierra su sesión en tu cuenta y se quita de todos los hosts a la vez. Para volver a usarlo, inicia sesión otra vez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wird von deinem Account abgemeldet und sofort von jedem Host entfernt. Um es wieder zu nutzen, melde es erneut an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is signing in from this computer. Allow or decline it in Sikemux.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il se connecte depuis cet ordinateur. Autorisez-le ou refusez-le dans Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Está iniciando sesión desde este ordenador. Permítelo o recházalo en Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es meldet sich von diesem Computer aus an. Erlaube oder lehne es in Sikemux ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It keeps running after Sikemux quits, as your agents do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il continue de tourner après la fermeture de Sikemux, comme vos agents."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigue ejecutándose después de cerrar Sikemux, igual que tus agentes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es läuft weiter, wenn Sikemux beendet wird, wie deine Agents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be off, asleep or offline, or its core stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est peut-être éteint, en veille ou hors ligne, ou son cœur s'est arrêté."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puede que esté apagado, en reposo o sin conexión, o que su núcleo se haya detenido."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist vielleicht aus, im Ruhezustand oder offline, oder sein Core wurde gestoppt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be offline, or a firewall blocks it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est peut-être hors ligne, ou un pare-feu le bloque."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puede que esté sin conexión o que un cortafuegos lo bloquee."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist vielleicht offline, oder eine Firewall blockiert es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It restarts once you leave the keys for 10 minutes; terminals and chats carry over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il redémarre quand vous n'avez pas touché au clavier depuis 10 minutes ; terminaux et chats sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se reinicia cuando llevas 10 minutos sin tocar el teclado; las terminales y los chats continúan."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es startet neu, sobald du 10 Minuten nicht getippt hast; Terminals und Chats bleiben erhalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It shows everything the agent read and ran, including the contents of files and any secrets in them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il montre tout ce que l'agent a lu et exécuté, y compris le contenu des fichiers et les secrets qu'ils contiennent."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muestra todo lo que el agente leyó y ejecutó, incluido el contenido de los archivos y cualquier secreto que contengan."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es zeigt alles, was der Agent gelesen und ausgeführt hat, einschließlich Dateiinhalten und darin enthaltener Secrets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It shows in the device menu while Wireless debugging is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il apparaît dans le menu des appareils tant que le débogage sans fil est activé."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aparece en el menú de dispositivos mientras la depuración inalámbrica está activada."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es erscheint im Gerätemenü, solange kabelloses Debugging an ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stays on your account and keeps reaching your other hosts. It reaches this one again only when you allow it, with no more access than it has now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il reste sur votre compte et continue d'atteindre vos autres hôtes. Il n'atteint à nouveau celui-ci que si vous l'autorisez, sans plus d'accès qu'il n'en a maintenant."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se queda en tu cuenta y sigue accediendo a tus otros hosts. Vuelve a acceder a este solo cuando lo permitas, sin más acceso del que tiene ahora."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es bleibt auf deinem Account und erreicht weiter deine anderen Hosts. Diesen erreicht es erst wieder, wenn du es erlaubst, mit nicht mehr Zugriff als jetzt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops what it is running now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il arrête ce qu'il exécute en ce moment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detiene lo que está ejecutando ahora."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es stoppt, was es gerade ausführt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not brought back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien n'a été rétabli"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se recuperó"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht zurückgeholt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été modifié"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se cambió"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht geändert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not counted as production": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été compté comme production"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se contó como producción"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht als Produktion gezählt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not moved": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été déplacé"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se movió"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht verschoben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not moved back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été remis"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se devolvió"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht zurückverschoben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not overruled": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien n'a été contredit"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se anuló"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht überstimmt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not put back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien n'a été rétabli"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se restauró"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht zurückgesetzt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été supprimé"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se eliminó"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht entfernt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not reopened": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été rouvert"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se reabrió"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht wieder geöffnet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été envoyé"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se envió"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht gesendet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was not taken back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'a pas été repris"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se retiró"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht zurückgenommen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its address, command or name, as the menu shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son adresse, sa commande ou son nom, comme le menu l'affiche"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su dirección, comando o nombre, como lo muestra el menú"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Adresse, sein Befehl oder Name, wie das Menü es zeigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its agents could start agents here, on this host's sign-ins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses agents pourraient démarrer des agents ici, avec les connexions de cet hôte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sus agentes podrían iniciar agentes aquí, con los inicios de sesión de este host."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Agents könnten hier Agents starten, mit den Anmeldungen dieses Hosts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its agents could start agents here. Allow or decline it in Sikemux.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses agents pourraient démarrer des agents ici. Autorisez-le ou refusez-le dans Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sus agentes podrían iniciar agentes aquí. Permítelo o recházalo en Sikemux."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Agents könnten hier Agents starten. Erlaube oder lehne es in Sikemux ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its core (pid {pid}) is still running but stopped responding. Restarting it ends its terminals; chats pick up where they were.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son cœur (pid {pid}) tourne encore mais ne répond plus. Le redémarrer ferme ses terminaux ; les chats reprennent où ils en étaient."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su núcleo (pid {pid}) sigue en marcha pero dejó de responder. Al reiniciarlo se cierran sus terminales; los chats siguen donde estaban."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sein Core (PID {pid}) läuft noch, reagiert aber nicht mehr. Ein Neustart beendet seine Terminals; Chats machen dort weiter, wo sie waren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its folder moves to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son dossier part à la Corbeille."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su carpeta va a la Papelera."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sein Ordner wird in den Papierkorb gelegt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its name, such as acme.dev on Vercel": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son nom, comme acme.dev sur Vercel"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su nombre, como acme.dev en Vercel"
